{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2021-10-21 06:33:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 NET INCOME OF $616 MILLION, OR $.65 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CLEVELAND , OCT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) TODAY ANNOUNCED NET INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS ATTRIBUTABLE TO KEY COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $616 MILLION, OR $.65 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021. THIS COMPARED TO $698 MILLION, OR $.72 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021 AND $397 MILLION, OR $.41 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020.'}